_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194539?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1915,"digest":"sha256:3f82f02be807b090b41dddd02eec6260b50a3c3bbfaa1405cbf46d3d65abe540","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-24T00:16:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-24T00:16:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.96.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.96.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.96.0","body":"## RevealLine v0.96.0 — Community authoring and recovery guide\n\nThis release gives creators a reproducible path from a small local mission to a recoverable community game candidate.\n\n- Content Studio now includes a concise in-place guide for project inspection, one-mission iteration, checkpoints, backup/restore, Team exports, presentation work, and release qualification.\n- The repository includes a validated example `ContentProjectV1` project and detailed local authoring/recovery instructions.\n- Asset Studio now explains that crop derivatives apply to images, while font and audio uploads retain their own formats and slot requirements.\n- Copyable prompts cover campaign candidates, complete presentation briefs, immutable asset replacement, Team import recovery, and release qualification.\n\nSource: `781e1c3b82236003bf8600a2cac0b5022e4298c1` (tree `37030950049bdc752eff86cb9664b12e6f74c0c0`), merged through PR #312. Qualification-only PR #317 proved the same game, package, lockfile, build, test and workflow bytes; its sole difference was an explicitly reviewed `docs/` trigger file.\n\nExact-source proof run 35936765953 passed preflight and the mandatory build. Merged-source qualification and freeze run 35892776329 passed. Read-only artifact inspection run 35896091020 returned `INSPECTED_VERIFIED` and verified source identity, the release hash chain, every distribution manifest byte, and all 957 offline files.\n\nAutomated broad suites remain explicitly waived under the committed temporary test policy. They were skipped, not passed. Public Pages deployment and public-byte/browser acceptance remain separate gates.\n\nOriginal source archive: 1,655,377,920 bytes, SHA-256 `3f7f4523907b2d109d3782aa88c56ea69b0280ed6fac07de8bc110194f551c5f`.\n\nOriginal distribution: 595,067,829 bytes, SHA-256 `e7021eea7375d49b26774ad40b65e8d9f81818053ae0c0ce4e61c1e3bc339575`.\n"}